### =============================================================
### <Resource> — full coverage HTTP test suite
### Covers every route, query param, body validation rule and error
### path exposed by <discovered-controller-path>.
### =============================================================

### Variables
@base_url = http://localhost:<port>
@write_key = {{$dotenv API_WRITE_KEY}}
@published_slug = <seeded-slug>
@missing_slug = does-not-exist
@malformed_slug = NotAKebabCase

### =============================================================
### 1. VARIABLES + AUTH SANITY
### =============================================================

### 1.1 Health (sanity)
GET {{base_url}}/health

### =============================================================
### 2. <RESOURCE> READ
### Endpoints: GET /<resource>, GET /<resource>/:slug
### =============================================================

### 2.A.1 List (default)
# @name list
GET {{base_url}}/<resource>

### 2.B.1 Detail (happy path)
GET {{base_url}}/<resource>/{{published_slug}}

### 2.B.2 Detail not found (expect 404 <NOT_FOUND_CODE>)
GET {{base_url}}/<resource>/{{missing_slug}}

### =============================================================
### N. METHOD / HEADER ERRORS
### =============================================================

### N.1 OPTIONS on list (sanity)
OPTIONS {{base_url}}/<resource>
